#!args --demo
# the demo headless: its view draws on a device of its own and every frame is read back; a drag pans the drawing with
# the pointer, the wheel zooms at the pointer (the red line through x = 0 is 9 px wide, at the view's middle, x 360; the
# blue line through y = 50 is 5 px wide, at y 222; the view starts at y 32, 1 unit = 1 px)
wait 600
expect pixel 358 300 #D02020
expect pixel 600 222 #2040C0
drag 358,300 458,300
wait 200
expect pixel 458 300 #D02020
expect pixel 358 300 #F4F1EA
# one notch at (458, 300): 2^(1/4) larger about the pointer, the red line stays under it, the blue line moves up to 207
wheel 458,300 120
wait 200
expect pixel 458 300 #D02020
expect pixel 600 207 #2040C0
